tooltip.arcanism.machine.steam_turbine.m:
Switch: on/off;
Halt/Void: halt=stop when output is full, Void=void excess output without blocking;
Overclock: actual power=1M×factor(W), expected power=5M×((factor+0.5)²-0.25)(W), higher factor means lower efficiency

Switch: on/off;
Halt/Void: halt=stop when output is full, Void=void excess output without blocking;
Overclock: actual power=1M×factor(W), expected power=5M×((factor+0.5)²-0.25)(W), higher factor means lower efficiency

tooltip.arcanism.machine.water_pump.usag:
Water must be below the front face. Pumped water exits the fluid output (on the machine itself).
Attach a mana connector to the link point 1 up-front;
higher overclock means more flow but exponentially more radiation cost.

tooltip.arcanism.machine.water_pump.mode:
Switch: on/off;
Overclock: pump power=1000×factor(W), cost=4^(factor-1)×300(W) radiation + 2000×factor(W) momentum,
radiation cost grows exponentially

tooltip.arcanism.machine.liquid_heater.m:
Switch: on/off;
Fuel/Mana: toggle between burning fuel and consuming temperature mana;
Overclock: energy per liter=4M×(factor+1)(J), higher factor converts faster
